font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><b>Parameter: </b>Integer<br><br> To get the estimated remaining flight time. Unit: second. The estimated remaining flight time is the time required for the aircraft to return home with 10% of the remaining battery power, including the time for the aircraft to land. If the aircraft is using the simulator, the value will be 0.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the estimated remaining flight time.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtogohome\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtogohome_inline\">getTimeNeededToGoHome</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtogohome_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getTimeNeededToGoHome</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getTimeNeededToGoHome</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><b>Parameter: </b>Integer<br><br> To get the time required to complete smart return-to-home. Unit: second. The estimated time of the aircraft flying from present location to home point.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the time required to complete smart return-to-home.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtoland\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtoland_inline\">getTimeNeededToLand</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtoland_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getTimeNeededToLand</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getTimeNeededToLand</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><b>Parameter: </b>Integer<br><br> To get the time required to complete the landing. Unit: second. The estimated time of the aircraft to complete landing in the present position.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the time required to complete landing.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtogohome\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtogohome_inline\">getBatteryPercentNeededToGoHome</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtogohome_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getBatteryPercentNeededToGoHome</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getBatteryPercentNeededToGoHome</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><b>Parameter: </b>Integer<br><br> To get the remaining power percentage when the aircraft needs smart low battery return-to-home. When the remaining power percentage is lower than this value, low battery return-to-home will be prompted.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the remaining power percentage when the aircraft needs to return home.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtoland\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtoland_inline\">getBatteryPercentNeededToLand</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getbatterypercentneededtoland_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getBatteryPercentNeededToLand</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getBatteryPercentNeededToLand</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><b>Parameter: </b>Integer<br><br> To get the remaining power percentage when the aircraft needs of low battery landing. When the remaining power percentage is lower than this value, the low battery landing will be prompted.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the remaining power percentage when the aircraft needs to land.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getmaxradiuscanflyandgohome\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getmaxradiuscanflyandgohome_inline\">getMaxRadiusCanFlyAndGoHome</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getmaxradiuscanflyandgohome_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getMaxRadiusCanFlyAndGoHome</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Double</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getMaxRadiusCanFlyAndGoHome</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the maximum safety flight radius with the home point as the center. Unit: meter. The maximum safety flight radius that the aircraft can safely return to the home point， which is calculated based on the flight altitude, distance from the home point, remaining battery power and other information. If the flight distance of the aircraft exceeds the radius, the aircraft may land on the way back.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Double</font></code></td><td>Return the maximum safty flight radius with the home point as the center.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthcountdown\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthcountdown_inline\">getSmartRTHCountdown</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthcountdown_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getSmartRTHCountdown</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getSmartRTHCountdown</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the user confirmed countdown when returning home in low battery. Unit: second. Once the countdown reaches 0, the aircraft will automatically return home. Only when the <code><a href=\"Value_FlightController_Struct_GoHomeAssessment.html#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthstate\">getLowBatteryRTHStatus</a></code> is <code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_flightcontroller_enum_smartrthstate_counting_down\">COUNTING_DOWN</a></code>, it can work.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Integer</font></code></td><td>Return the user confirmed countdown when returning to home in low battery.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthstate\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthstate_inline\">getLowBatteryRTHStatus</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getsmartrthstate_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getLowBatteryRTHStatus</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">LowBatteryRTHState</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getLowBatteryRTHStatus</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.flightcontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">To get the status of low battery return-to-home.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_flightcontroller_enum_smartrthstate\">LowBatteryRTHState</a></font></code></td><td>Return the status of low battery return-to-home.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">Methods</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getremainingflighttime\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_getremainingflighttime\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getRemainingFlightTime</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gettimeneededtogohome\" data-target=\"value_flightcontroller_struct_gohomeassessment_gett